#. translators: %s: number of seconds, e.g. 4.2.
msgid "%s seconds (from banner shown to the visitor’s choice)."
msgstr "%s sekondi (minn meta jintwera l-banner sal-għażla tal-viżitatur)."

msgid ""
"A small icon-only button that lets visitors reopen the cookie settings after"
" they have made a choice. It is automatically hidden while the banner or "
"preferences dialog is open."
msgstr ""
"Buttuna żgħira b’ikona biss li tippermetti lill-viżitaturi jerġgħu jiftħu "
"s-settings tal-cookies wara li jkunu għamlu għażla. Tinħeba awtomatikament "
"waqt li l-banner jew id-djalogu tal-preferenzi jkunu miftuħin."

msgid "About"
msgstr "Dwar"

msgid "About Lynbro Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Dwar Lynbro Cookie Consent"

msgid "Accept all"
msgstr "Aċċetta kollox"

msgid "Accept button"
msgstr "Buttuna ta’ aċċettazzjoni"

msgid "Accept rate"
msgstr "Rata ta’ aċċettazzjoni"

msgid "Accessible label"
msgstr "Tikketta aċċessibbli"

msgid "Add a custom language"
msgstr "Żid lingwa personalizzata"

msgid ""
"Add a small language dropdown to the banner so visitors can switch language "
"manually (their choice is remembered)."
msgstr ""
"Żid dropdown żgħir tal-lingwa mal-banner sabiex il-viżitaturi jkunu jistgħu "
"jibdlu l-lingwa manwalment (l-għażla tagħhom tinżamm)."

msgid "Add your privacy policy link"
msgstr "Żid il-link għall-politika tal-privatezza tiegħek"

msgid "Additional CSS"
msgstr "CSS addizzjonali"

msgid ""
"Allow the website to remember choices you make (such as language or region) "
"to provide enhanced, personalized features."
msgstr ""
"Ħalli l-websajt tiftakar l-għażliet li tagħmel (bħal lingwa jew reġjun) biex"
" tipprovdi karatteristiċi mtejba u personalizzati."

msgid "Already downloaded on demand:"
msgstr "Diġà mniżżel fuq talba:"

msgid "Always allow %s"
msgstr "Dejjem ħalli %s"

msgid "Always on"
msgstr "Dejjem attiv"

msgid "Android"
msgstr "Android"

msgid "Anonymous statistics"
msgstr "Statistika anonima"

msgid "Auto (follow visitor’s system)"
msgstr "Awtomatiku (segwi s-sistema tal-viżitatur)"

msgid "Auto by region"
msgstr "Awtomatiku skont ir-reġjun"

msgid "Auto by region (EU opt-in, US opt-out, rest by choice)"
msgstr ""
"Awtomatiku skont ir-reġjun (opt-in fl-UE, opt-out fl-Istati Uniti, il-bqija "
"skont l-għażla)"

msgid ""
"Auto uses the light colors by default and the dark colors when the visitor’s"
" device prefers a dark color scheme."
msgstr ""
"Il-modalità awtomatika tuża l-kuluri ċari b’mod awtomatiku u l-kuluri skuri "
"meta l-apparat tal-viżitatur jippreferi skema ta’ kuluri skuri."

msgid "Auto-block trackers"
msgstr "Imblokka traċċaturi awtomatikament"

msgid "Auto-detect visitor language"
msgstr "Skopri awtomatikament il-lingwa tal-viżitatur"

msgid "Automatic tracker blocking"
msgstr "Imblukkar awtomatiku tat-traċċaturi"

msgid ""
"Automatically block known third-party trackers (Google Analytics, GTM, Meta "
"Pixel, Hotjar, Clarity, and more) until the matching category is granted."
msgstr ""
"Imblokka awtomatikament traċċaturi ta’ partijiet terzi magħrufa (Google "
"Analytics, GTM, Meta Pixel, Hotjar, Clarity, u aktar) sakemm il-kategorija "
"korrispondenti tiġi aċċettata."

msgid ""
"Automatically show the banner in the visitor’s browser language when it is "
"one of the offered languages."
msgstr ""
"Uri awtomatikament il-banner bil-lingwa tal-browser tal-viżitatur meta tkun "
"waħda mil-lingwi offruti."

msgid "Average time to decision"
msgstr "Ħin medju sad-deċiżjoni"

msgid "Background color"
msgstr "Kulur tal-isfond"

msgid "Banner background"
msgstr "Sfond tal-banner"

msgid "Banner description"
msgstr "Deskrizzjoni tal-banner"

msgid "Banner max width (px)"
msgstr "Wisa’ massima tal-banner (px)"

msgid "Banner shown"
msgstr "Banner muri"

msgid "Banner text on background"
msgstr "Test tal-banner fuq l-isfond"

msgid "Banner title"
msgstr "Titlu tal-banner"

msgid ""
"Base z-index for the banner, overlay, modal and floating button. Increase it"
" if another element covers the banner; lower it if the banner covers "
"something it should not."
msgstr ""
"Valur z-index bażiku għall-banner, l-overlay, it-tieqa modali u l-buttuna "
"galleġġjanti. Żidu jekk element ieħor jgħatti l-banner; naqqsu jekk il-"
"banner jgħatti xi ħaġa li m’għandux."

msgid ""
"Basic HTML allowed: links, bold, italic, line breaks. Leave empty for the "
"translated default."
msgstr ""
"HTML bażiku permess: links, grassett, korsiv, qtugħ tal-linji. Ħallih vojt "
"għall-valur awtomatiku tradott."

msgid "Benchmark sharing"
msgstr "Qsim ta’ benchmark"

msgid ""
"Benchmark sharing is on. Your first comparison will appear here after the "
"weekly report has run."
msgstr ""
"Il-qsim ta’ benchmark huwa attiv. L-ewwel tqabbil tiegħek jidher hawn wara "
"li jitħaddem ir-rapport ta’ kull ġimgħa."

msgid ""
"Block embedded content (YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, social embeds, "
"reCAPTCHA, and more) until consent, showing a tidy placeholder with an "
"\"allow\" button."
msgstr ""
"Imblokka kontenut inkorporat (YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, embeds soċjali, "
"reCAPTCHA, u aktar) sakemm jingħata l-kunsens, billi turi placeholder pulit "
"b’buttuna “ħalli”."

msgid "Blocking & Embeds"
msgstr "Imblukkar u inkorporazzjonijiet"

msgid "Bottom bar"
msgstr "Barra fil-qiegħ"

msgid "Bottom left"
msgstr "Fin-naħa t’isfel tax-xellug"

msgid "Bottom right"
msgstr "Fin-naħa t’isfel tal-lemin"

