msgstr "Placeholders għall-embeds"

msgid ""
"Embeds are unblocked when the visitor grants this category (or clicks "
"\"allow\" on the placeholder)."
msgstr ""
"L-embeds jiġu żblukkati meta l-viżitatur jagħti l-kunsens għal din il-"
"kategorija (jew jikklikkja \"allow\" fuq il-placeholder)."

msgid "Enable Google Consent Mode v2 signals"
msgstr "Ippermetti s-sinjali ta’ Google Consent Mode v2"

msgid "Enable this category"
msgstr "Ippermetti din il-kategorija"

msgid "Engagement (last 30 days)"
msgstr "Interazzjoni (l-aħħar 30 jum)"

msgid ""
"Enjoying Lynbro Cookie Consent? A short, honest review helps other site "
"owners find it. No pressure — only if you have a minute."
msgstr ""
"Qed jogħġbok Lynbro Cookie Consent? Reċensjoni qasira u onesta tgħin lil "
"sidien oħra ta’ siti jsibuh. Ebda pressjoni — biss jekk għandek minuta."

msgid ""
"Enter a WordPress locale code (for example pt_PT or ca) to offer a language "
"that is not bundled. After saving, fill in its texts below."
msgstr ""
"Daħħal kodiċi tal-locale ta’ WordPress (pereżempju pt_PT jew ca) biex toffri"
" lingwa li mhix inkluża. Wara li ssalva, imla t-testi tagħha hawn taħt."

msgid "Exclude pages/posts"
msgstr "Eskludi paġni/postijiet"

msgid "Export CSV"
msgstr "Esporta CSV"

msgid "Export settings"
msgstr "Esporta s-settings"

msgid "Export settings (JSON)"
msgstr "Esporta s-settings (JSON)"

