msgstr "Kaxxa flottanti (rokna)"

msgid "Floating settings button"
msgstr "Buttuna flottanti tas-settings"

msgid "Gap from the screen edges for the floating box layout."
msgstr "Id-distakk mit-truf tal-iskrin għat-tqassim tal-kaxxa flottanti."

msgid "General"
msgstr "Ġenerali"

msgid "Get support"
msgstr "Ikseb appoġġ"

msgid "Global Privacy Control (GPC)"
msgstr "Kontroll tal-Privatezza Globali (GPC)"

msgid "Good contrast (%s:1) — meets WCAG AA."
msgstr "Kuntrast tajjeb (%s:1) — jissodisfa WCAG AA."

msgid "Google Consent Mode v2"
msgstr "Google Consent Mode v2"

msgid ""
"Have an idea, a problem or a request? Send it straight to the developers. "
"This is entirely optional and only sent when you click Send."
msgstr ""
"Għandek idea, problema jew talba? Ibgħatha direttament lill-iżviluppaturi. "
"Dan huwa kompletament fakultattiv u jintbagħat biss meta tikklikkja Ibgħat."

msgid ""
"Help us understand how visitors interact with the website by collecting and "
"reporting information anonymously."
msgstr ""
"Għinna nifhmu kif il-viżitaturi jinteraġixxu mas-sit web billi niġbru u "
"nirrapportaw informazzjoni b'mod anonimu."

msgid ""
"Honor the browser Global Privacy Control signal. In opt-out (US/CCPA) mode, "
"visitors with GPC are automatically opted out and shown a visible "
"confirmation (required by California from 2026)."
msgstr ""
"Irrispetta s-sinjal Global Privacy Control tal-browser. Fil-modalità ta’ "
"opt-out (US/CCPA), il-viżitaturi b’GPC jiġu awtomatikament esklużi u "
"tintwerielhom konferma viżibbli (meħtieġa fil-Kalifornja mill-2026)."

msgid "Horizontal"
msgstr "Orizzontali"

msgid "How you compare"
msgstr "Kif tqabbel ma’ oħrajn"

msgid "Icon"
msgstr "Ikona"

msgid "Icon color"
msgstr "Kulur tal-ikona"

msgid "Idea for a new feature or plugin"
msgstr "Idea għal funzjonalità jew plugin ġdid"

msgid "Import settings"
msgstr "Importa s-settings"

msgid "Importing overwrites your current settings."
msgstr "L-importazzjoni tissostitwixxi s-settings attwali tiegħek."

msgid ""
"Increase this number whenever your cookie policy changes. Visitors will be "
"asked to consent again."
msgstr ""
"Żid dan in-numru kull meta l-politika tal-cookies tiegħek tinbidel. Il-"
"viżitaturi jintalbu jagħtu l-kunsens mill-ġdid."

msgid "Installed version"
msgstr "Verżjoni installata"

msgid "Invalid security token."
msgstr "Token tas-sigurtà mhux validu."

msgid ""
"It works out of the box with GDPR-ready defaults — an equal Reject button "
"and non-essential cookies blocked until consent."
msgstr ""
"Jaħdem mill-ewwel b’settings predefiniti lesti għall-GDPR — b’buttuna "
"“Irrifjuta” ugwali u bil-cookies mhux essenzjali mblukkati sakemm jingħata "
"l-kunsens."

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Lingwa"

msgid "Language downloaded and activated."
msgstr "Il-lingwa tniżżlet u ġiet attivata."

msgid "Language settings saved."
msgstr "Is-settings tal-lingwa ġew salvati."

