msgstr "Ċar"

msgid "Light colors"
msgstr "Kuluri ċari"

msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

msgid "Live preview (updates as you change Design and General settings):"
msgstr ""
"Previżjoni diretta (tiġi aġġornata hekk kif tibdel is-settings tad-Disinn u "
"dawk Ġenerali):"

msgid "Load content from %s"
msgstr "Għabbi l-kontenut minn %s"

msgid "Local consent log"
msgstr "Reġistru lokali tal-kunsens"

msgid "Low contrast (%s:1). Aim for at least 4.5:1 to meet WCAG AA."
msgstr ""
"Kontrast baxx (%s:1). Immira għal mill-inqas 4.5:1 biex tissodisfa l-WCAG "
"AA."

msgid ""
"Lynbro Cookie Consent is a free, privacy-first cookie banner built by "
"Lynbro. Our goal is a beautiful, genuinely multilingual, GDPR/ePrivacy-ready"
" banner with an equal Reject button — and no pageview limits, no paywall on "
"the essentials, and no front-end tracking."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro Cookie Consent huwa banner tal-cookies b’xejn u b’fokus fuq il-"
"privatezza, mibni minn Lynbro. L-għan tagħna huwa banner sabiħ, tassew "
"multilingwi, lest għall-GDPR/ePrivacy, b’buttuna “Irrifjuta” ugwali — u "
"mingħajr limiti fuq il-veduti tal-paġni, mingħajr ħajt ta’ ħlas għall-"
"affarijiet essenzjali, u mingħajr traċċar fuq il-front end."

msgid "Manage opened"
msgstr "Infetħet it-tieqa tal-immaniġġjar"

msgid "Manage preferences"
msgstr "Immaniġġja l-preferenzi"

msgid "Manage-preferences button"
msgstr "Buttuna “Immaniġġja l-preferenzi”"

msgid "Marketing"
msgstr "Marketing"

msgid ""
"Maximum width of the floating box and center modal. Set 0 to use the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Wisa’ massima tal-kaxxa flotanti u tat-tieqa modali ċentrali. Issettja 0 "
"biex tuża l-valur predefinit."

msgid "Message"
msgstr "Messaġġ"

msgid "Method"
msgstr "Metodu"

msgid "Mobile"
msgstr "Mobbli"

msgid "Necessary"
msgstr "Meħtieġa"

msgid ""
"Necessary cookies are always active and cannot be disabled. Choose which "
"optional categories visitors can control."
msgstr ""
"Il-cookies meħtieġa huma dejjem attivi u ma jistgħux jiġu diżattivati. "
"Agħżel liema kategoriji fakultattivi l-viżitaturi jistgħu jikkontrollaw."

msgid ""
"Need a language that is not bundled? Request it and we will generate it for "
"your site. The translation file is stored in your uploads folder (never "
"overwritten on update) and activated automatically."
msgstr ""
"Għandek bżonn lingwa li mhix inkluża? Itlobha u niġġenerawha għas-sit "
"tiegħek. Il-fajl tat-traduzzjoni jinħażen fil-fowlder tal-uploads tiegħek "
"(qatt ma jinkiteb fuqu waqt aġġornament) u jiġi attivat awtomatikament."

msgid "No consent records yet."
msgstr "Għad m’hemmx rekords tal-kunsens."

msgid "No data yet."
msgstr "Għad m’hemmx dejta."

msgid "No file was uploaded."
msgstr "Ma ttella’ l-ebda fajl."

msgid "No thanks, don’t show this again"
msgstr "Le grazzi, turinix dan aktar"

msgid "Notice only"
msgstr "Avviż biss"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Mitfi"

msgid "Offered languages"
msgstr "Lingwi offruti"

msgid "Offset from corner (px)"
msgstr "Distanza mill-kantuniera (px)"

msgid "On"
msgstr "Mixgħul"

msgid "Once Weekly"
msgstr "Darba fil-ġimgħa"

msgid "Only if you would like a reply. Leave empty to send anonymously."
msgstr "Biss jekk tixtieq tweġiba. Ħalli vojt biex tibgħat b’mod anonimu."

msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Opakità"

msgid "Operating systems"
msgstr "Sistemi operattivi"

msgid "Opt-in everywhere"
msgstr "Opt-in kullimkien"

msgid "Opt-in everywhere (GDPR — safest)"
msgstr "Opt-in kullimkien (GDPR — l-aktar sigur)"

msgid "Opt-out everywhere"
msgstr "Opt-out kullimkien"

msgid "Opt-out everywhere (CCPA style)"
msgstr "Opt-out kullimkien (stil CCPA)"

msgid ""
"Optional CSS appended to the banner stylesheet. Target the .lynbro-cc "
"selectors."
msgstr ""
"CSS mhux obbligatorju miżjud mal-folja tal-istili tal-banner. Uża "
"s-seletturi .lynbro-cc bħala mira."

msgid "Other"
msgstr "Oħrajn"

msgid ""
"Override any banner text for a specific language. Leave a field empty to use"
" the bundled translation (or the English default). Priority: your override →"
" bundled translation → default."
msgstr ""
"Ibdel kwalunkwe test tal-banner għal lingwa speċifika. Ħalli qasam vojt biex"
" tintuża t-traduzzjoni inkluża (jew il-valur awtomatiku bl-Ingliż). "
"Prijorità: is-sostituzzjoni tiegħek → it-traduzzjoni inkluża → il-valur "
"awtomatiku."

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ħarsa ġenerali"

msgid "Period"
msgstr "Perjodu"

msgid "Please choose a valid language code."
msgstr "Jekk jogħġbok agħżel kodiċi tal-lingwa validu."

msgid "Please enter a message before sending."
msgstr "Jekk jogħġbok daħħal messaġġ qabel tibgħat."

msgid "Please upload a .json settings file."
msgstr "Jekk jogħġbok ittella’ fajl .json tas-settings."

msgid "Plugin home page"
msgstr "Paġna ewlenija tal-plug-in"

msgid "Policy URL"
msgstr "URL tal-politika"

msgid "Policy version"
msgstr "Verżjoni tal-politika"

msgid "Position"
msgstr "Pożizzjoni"

msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Preferenzi"

msgid "Privacy Policy & Terms"
msgstr "Politika tal-privatezza u termini"

msgid "Privacy/Cookie policy URL"
msgstr "URL tal-politika tal-privatezza/cookies"

msgid ""
"Private, cookieless statistics stored only in your own database. They are "
"fully aggregated — no IP address, no visitor identifier and no personal data"
" is ever recorded. Because of that, these statistics do not by themselves "
"require consent."
msgstr ""
"Statistika privata u mingħajr cookies, maħżuna biss fid-database tiegħek "
"stess. Hija aggregata kompletament — qatt ma jiġu rreġistrati indirizz IP, "
"identifikatur tal-viżitatur jew dejta personali. Għalhekk, din l-istatistika"
" waħedha ma teħtieġx kunsens."

msgid "Read more"
msgstr "Aqra aktar"

msgid "Recent consent records"
msgstr "Rekords reċenti tal-kunsens"

msgid ""
"Records older than this are deleted automatically. Set to 0 to keep records "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"Rekords eqdem minn dan jitħassru awtomatikament. Issettja għal 0 biex iżżomm"
" ir-rekords għal żmien indefinit."

msgid "Region"
msgstr "Reġjun"

msgid ""
"Region is detected from CDN/edge headers (e.g. Cloudflare). When unknown, "
"the safest opt-in model is used. No external geolocation API is called."
msgstr ""
"Ir-reġjun jiġi skopert minn headers tas-CDN/edge (eż. Cloudflare). Meta ma "
"jkunx magħruf, jintuża l-aktar mudell sigur ta’ opt-in. Ma tintuża l-ebda "
"API esterna tal-ġeolokalizzazzjoni."

msgid ""
"Register as the consent provider for the WP Consent API plugin and notify "
"other plugins of the visitor’s choice (functional, preferences, statistics, "
"marketing)."
msgstr ""
"Irreġistra bħala l-fornitur tal-kunsens għall-plug-in WP Consent API u avża "
"plugins oħra bl-għażla tal-viżitatur (funzjonali, preferenzi, statistika, "
"kummerċjalizzazzjoni)."

msgid "Reject all"
msgstr "Irrifjuta kollox"

msgid "Reject button"
msgstr "Buttuna tar-rifjut"

msgid "Report a bug"
msgstr "Irrapporta żball"

msgid "Request a language"
msgstr "Itlob lingwa"

msgid "Request this language"
msgstr "Itlob din il-lingwa"

msgid ""
"Required for the website to function and cannot be switched off. They are "
"usually set in response to actions you make, such as setting privacy "
"preferences or logging in."
msgstr ""
"Meħtieġa biex is-sit web jiffunzjona u ma jistgħux jintfew. Normalment jiġu "
"ssettjati b’reazzjoni għal azzjonijiet li tagħmel, bħall-issettjar tal-"
"preferenzi tal-privatezza jew id-dħul fis-sistema."

msgid ""
"Resting transparency (0.2–1.0). The button becomes fully opaque on hover or "
"focus. Default is 0.55."
msgstr ""
"Trasparenza fi stat inattiv (0.2–1.0). Il-buttuna ssir kompletament opaka "
"meta tgħaddi l-maws fuqha jew meta tkun iffukata. Il-valur awtomatiku huwa "
"0.55."

msgid "Retention (days)"
msgstr "Żamma (jiem)"

msgid "Round"
msgstr "Tond"

msgid "Rounded"
msgstr "Ittundjat"

msgid ""
"Rounding of the banner, box and modal corners. Set 0 to use the default."
msgstr ""
"It-ttundjar tal-kantunieri tal-banner, tal-kaxxa u tal-modal. Issettja għal "
"0 biex tuża l-valur awtomatiku."

msgid "Save language settings"
msgstr "Issejvja l-issettjar tal-lingwa"

msgid "Save preferences"
msgstr "Issejvja l-preferenzi"

msgid "Save-preferences button"
msgstr "Buttuna biex jiġu ssejvjati l-preferenzi"

msgid "Send feedback"
msgstr "Ibgħat feedback"

#. translators: %s: link to the portal privacy/terms page.
msgid ""
"Sends only the plugin name, version and language code to the Lynbro portal. "
"See our %s."
msgstr ""
"Jibgħat biss l-isem tal-plugin, il-verżjoni u l-kodiċi tal-lingwa lill-"
"portal Lynbro. Ara l-%s tagħna."

msgid "Set"
msgstr "Issettja"

msgid ""
"Sets all consent signals to \"denied\" by default before consent, then "
"updates them based on the visitor’s choice (ad_storage, analytics_storage, "
"ad_user_data, ad_personalization, functionality_storage, "
"personalization_storage, security_storage)."
msgstr ""
"Jissettja s-sinjali kollha tal-kunsens għal \"denied\" b’mod awtomatiku "
"qabel jingħata l-kunsens, imbagħad jaġġornahom skont l-għażla tal-viżitatur "
"(ad_storage, analytics_storage, ad_user_data, ad_personalization, "
"functionality_storage, personalization_storage, security_storage)."

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Issettjar"

msgid "Settings imported successfully."
msgstr "Is-settings ġew importati b'suċċess."

msgid "Shape"
msgstr "Forma"

msgid ""
"Share anonymous statistics to help improve the plugin — and see how your "
"accept rate compares to the average. Off by default. Sends only aggregated "
"numbers and your site domain (never visitor IPs) to the Lynbro portal, once "
"a week."
msgstr ""
"Aqsam statistika anonima biex tgħin fit-titjib tal-plugin — u ara kif ir-"
"rata ta' aċċettazzjoni tiegħek titqabbel mal-medja. Mitfi awtomatikament. "
"Jibgħat biss numri aggregati u d-dominju tas-sit tiegħek (qatt l-indirizzi "
"IP tal-viżitaturi) lill-portal Lynbro, darba fil-ġimgħa."

msgid ""
"Show a \"Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\" link in opt-out "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Uri link \"Tbigħx jew taqsamx l-informazzjoni personali tiegħi\" fil-"
"modalità opt-out."

msgid "Show floating settings button on the site"
msgstr "Uri l-buttuna tas-settings li tgħum fuq is-sit"

msgid "Show language switcher"
msgstr "Uri s-selettur tal-lingwa"

msgid ""
"Show the cookie icon (recommended). When off, the accessible label is shown "
"as a small text button instead."
msgstr ""
"Uri l-ikona tal-cookies (irrakkmandata). Meta tkun mitfija, it-tikketta "
"aċċessibbli tintwera bħala buttuna żgħira bit-test minflok."

msgid "Size (px)"
msgstr "Daqs (px)"

msgid ""
"Sorry, that language could not be fetched right now. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Skużana, dik il-lingwa ma setgħetx tinkiseb bħalissa. Jekk jogħġbok erġa' "
"pprova aktar tard."

msgid "Sorry, the message could not be sent. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Skużana, il-messaġġ ma setax jintbagħat. Jekk jogħġbok erġa' pprova aktar "
"tard."

msgid "Square"
msgstr "Kwadru"

msgid "Stacking (z-index base)"
msgstr "Ordni tas-saffi (bażi z-index)"

msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Statistika"

msgid ""
"Statistics are currently turned off. Enable “Collect anonymous statistics” "
"in the General tab to start collecting aggregated numbers."
msgstr ""
"L-istatistika bħalissa hija mitfija. Attiva “Iġbor statistika anonima” fit-"
"tab Ġenerali biex tibda tiġbor numri aggregati."

msgid "Statistics are disabled."
msgstr "L-istatistika hija diżattivata."

msgid ""
"Store a privacy-respecting proof of consent in your own database. No raw IP "
"address is stored — only a salted, anonymised hash for de-duplication."
msgstr ""
"Aħżen prova tal-kunsens li tirrispetta l-privatezza fid-database tiegħek "
"stess. Ma jinħażen l-ebda indirizz IP mhux ipproċessat — jinħażen biss hash "
"anonimizzat b'salt għad-deduplikazzjoni."

msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "Tablet"

msgid "Tell us what you think, what is missing, or what went wrong…"
msgstr "Għidilna x'taħseb, x'jonqos, jew x'ma marx tajjeb…"

msgid "Text color"
msgstr "Kulur tat-test"

msgid "Thank you! Your message was sent."
msgstr "Grazzi! Il-messaġġ tiegħek intbagħat."

#. translators: %s: the average accept rate across opted-in sites.
msgid ""
"The average accept rate across opted-in sites is %s%%. Yours will show here "
"once visitors start choosing."
msgstr ""
"Ir-rata medja ta' aċċettazzjoni fis-siti li għażlu li jipparteċipaw hija "
"%s%%. Tiegħek tidher hawnhekk ladarba l-viżitaturi jibdew jagħżlu."

msgid ""
"The banner language follows a cache-safe cascade: the current page language "
"(Polylang/WPML/TranslatePress), then your site language, then English. "
"Browser auto-detection and the optional in-banner switcher happen entirely "
"in the visitor’s browser, so your page cache is never affected."
msgstr ""
"Il-lingwa tal-banner issegwi sekwenza sigura għall-cache: il-lingwa attwali "
"tal-paġna (Polylang/WPML/TranslatePress), imbagħad il-lingwa tas-sit "
"tiegħek, imbagħad l-Ingliż. Id-detezzjoni awtomatika mill-brawżer u "
"s-selettur fakultattiv fil-banner iseħħu kompletament fil-brawżer tal-"
"viżitatur, għalhekk il-cache tal-paġna tiegħek qatt ma tiġi affettwata."

msgid "The file does not contain valid Lynbro Cookie Consent settings."
msgstr "Il-fajl ma fihx settings validi ta' Lynbro Cookie Consent."

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Tema"

msgid ""
"These are the languages prepared for browser auto-detection and the "
"switcher. Languages with a bundled translation appear here automatically. "
"Your site language is always included."
msgstr ""
"Dawn huma l-lingwi ppreparati għad-detezzjoni awtomatika mill-brawżer u "
"għas-selettur. Lingwi bi traduzzjoni inkluża fil-plugin jidhru hawn "
"awtomatikament. Il-lingwa tas-sit tiegħek hija dejjem inkluża."

msgid ""
"This complements manual script marking. All detection is local; no external "
"request is made."
msgstr ""
"Dan jikkomplementa l-immarkar manwali tal-iskripts. Id-detezzjoni kollha "
"ssir lokalment; ma ssir l-ebda talba esterna."

msgid ""
"This plugin helps with cookie compliance but does not constitute legal "
"advice."
msgstr ""
"Dan il-plugin jgħin fil-konformità mal-cookies iżda ma jikkostitwixxix parir"
" legali."

msgid ""
"Tip: cookie/consent wording can have legal implications. Have the legal "
"parts of any translation reviewed by a person familiar with your "
"jurisdiction."
msgstr ""
"Parir: il-kliem dwar il-cookies/kunsens jista' jkollu implikazzjonijiet "
"legali. Ħalli l-partijiet legali ta' kwalunkwe traduzzjoni jiġu riveduti "
"minn persuna familjari mal-ġurisdizzjoni tiegħek."

msgid ""
"To view this content from %s, you need to accept the relevant cookies. The "
"provider may set cookies and collect personal data."
msgstr ""
"Biex tara dan il-kontenut minn %s, għandek bżonn taċċetta l-cookies "
"rilevanti. Il-fornitur jista' jissettja cookies u jiġbor data personali."

msgid "Today"
msgstr "Illum"

msgid "Too many requests."
msgstr "Wisq talbiet."

msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Għodod"

msgid "Top bar"
msgstr "Strixxa ta' fuq"

msgid "Top left"
msgstr "Fuq ix-xellug"

msgid "Top right"
msgstr "Fuq il-lemin"

#. translators: %d: total number of consent records.
msgid "Total records: %d (showing the 50 most recent)."
msgstr "Rekords totali: %d (qed jintwerew l-50 l-aktar reċenti)."

msgid ""
"Unchecking this hides the floating button completely — visitors will not see"
" a way to reopen their cookie settings (unless you add the "
"[lynbro_cookie_settings] shortcode somewhere)."
msgstr ""
"Jekk tneħħi l-marka minn dan, il-buttuna li tgħum tinħeba kompletament — il-"
"viżitaturi ma jaraw l-ebda mod biex jerġgħu jiftħu s-settings tal-cookies "
"tagħhom (sakemm ma żżidx il-shortcode [lynbro_cookie_settings] xi mkien)."

msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Aġġornamenti"

msgid ""
"Updates are delivered automatically through WordPress.org — there is no "
"custom updater and the free version never phones home."
msgstr ""
"L-aġġornamenti jitwasslu awtomatikament permezz ta’ WordPress.org — m’hemmx "
"aġġornatur personalizzat u l-verżjoni b’xejn qatt ma tibgħat informazzjoni "
"lura."

msgid ""
"Used as the tooltip and screen-reader label. Leave empty for the translated "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Jintuża bħala t-tooltip u t-tikketta għall-qarrej tal-iskrin. Ħallih vojt "
"għall-valur predefinit tradott."

msgid "Used only when Position is \"Floating box\"."
msgstr "Jintuża biss meta l-Pożizzjoni tkun \"Kaxxa li tgħum\"."

msgid ""
"Used to track visitors across websites to display relevant advertising and "
"measure campaign effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Jintuża biex isegwi l-viżitaturi bejn websajts biex jintwerew reklami "
"rilevanti u titkejjel l-effettività tal-kampanji."

msgid "Version & updates"
msgstr "Verżjoni u aġġornamenti"

msgid "Vertical"
msgstr "Vertikali"

msgid "View changelog"
msgstr "Ara l-lista tal-bidliet"

msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Viżibbiltà"

msgid "Visit Lynbro"
msgstr "Żur Lynbro"

msgid "WP Consent API"
msgstr "WP Consent API"

msgid ""
"We detected a Global Privacy Control signal and automatically opted you out "
"of non-essential cookies."
msgstr ""
"Sibna sinjal ta’ Global Privacy Control u awtomatikament għażilna li ma "
"tużax cookies mhux essenzjali."

msgid ""
"We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized "
"content and analyze our traffic. You can accept all cookies, reject non-"
"essential ones, or manage your preferences."
msgstr ""
"Nużaw cookies biex intejbu l-esperjenza tiegħek tal-ibbrawżjar, nipprovdu "
"kontenut personalizzat u nanalizzaw it-traffiku tagħna. Tista’ taċċetta "
"l-cookies kollha, tirrifjuta dawk mhux essenzjali, jew timmaniġġa "
"l-preferenzi tiegħek."

msgid "We value your privacy"
msgstr "Napprezzaw il-privatezza tiegħek"

msgid "Width and height of the button (24–96). Default is 40."
msgstr "Wisa’ u għoli tal-buttuna (24–96). Il-valur predefinit huwa 40."

msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

msgid "Write a review"
msgstr "Ikteb reviżjoni"

msgid "Yesterday"
msgstr "Ilbieraħ"

msgid "You can still block your own scripts manually:"
msgstr "Tista’ xorta timblokka l-iskripts tiegħek stess manwalment:"

msgid "You do not have sufficient permissions to access this page."
msgstr "M’għandekx permessi biżżejjed biex taċċessa din il-paġna."

#. translators: 1: this site's accept rate, 2: the average accept rate across
#. opted-in sites.
msgid ""
"Your accept rate over the last 7 days is %1$s%%. The average across opted-in"
" sites is %2$s%%."
msgstr ""
"Ir-rata ta’ aċċettazzjoni tiegħek matul l-aħħar 7 ijiem hija %1$s%%. Il-"
"medja fost is-siti li għażlu li jipparteċipaw hija %2$s%%."

msgid "Your consent banner is live"
msgstr "Il-banner tal-kunsens tiegħek huwa attiv"

msgid "Your email (optional)"
msgstr "L-email tiegħek (mhux obbligatorja)"

#. translators: %s: link to the portal privacy/terms page.
msgid ""
"Your message, the plugin version and your site domain are sent to the Lynbro"
" portal. See our %s."
msgstr ""
"Il-messaġġ tiegħek, il-verżjoni tal-plugin u d-dominju tas-sit tiegħek "
"jintbagħtu lill-portal ta’ Lynbro. Ara %s tagħna."

msgid "\"Read more\" link"
msgstr "Link \"Aqra aktar\""

msgid "iOS"
msgstr "iOS"

msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

msgid "site language"
msgstr "lingwa tas-sit"

msgid ""
"Preparing your language… This can take about a minute the first time. It "
"will be added automatically — you can keep working."
msgstr ""
"Qed nippreparaw il-lingwa tiegħek… Dan jista’ jieħu madwar minuta l-ewwel "
"darba. Se tiżdied awtomatikament — tista’ tkompli taħdem."

#. %s: comma-separated list of language names.
msgid "Language ready and activated: %s"
msgstr "Il-lingwa hija lesta u attivata: %s"

#. %s: comma-separated list of language names.
msgid "Could not prepare: %s. Please try again later."
msgstr "Ma stajniex nippreparaw: %s. Jekk jogħġbok erġa’ pprova aktar tard."

msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Aċċessibilità"

msgid ""
"Apply this design preset? It will overwrite your current Design settings "
"(you can still review before saving)."
msgstr ""
"Tapplika dan il-preset tad-disinn? Se jissostitwixxi s-settings attwali tad-"
"Disinn tiegħek (xorta tista’ tirrevedi qabel issalva)."

msgid "Calm, low-contrast palette in a rounded corner box."
msgstr "Paletta kalma b’kuntrast baxx f’kaxxa b’kantunieri ttundjati."

msgid "Centered dialog with a dimmed overlay, dark theme."
msgstr "Djalogu ċċentrat b’saff ta’ sfond imdallam, tema skura."

msgid "Colours meet WCAG AA accessibility"
msgstr "Il-kuluri jissodisfaw ir-rekwiżiti ta’ aċċessibilità WCAG AA"

msgid "Design presets"
msgstr "Presets tad-disinn"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "Dettalji"

msgid "Full-width bar at the bottom, light and neutral."
msgstr "Strixxa b’wisa’ sħiħa fil-qiegħ, ċara u newtrali."

msgid "Hide details"
msgstr "Aħbi d-dettalji"

msgid ""
"One-click starting points. Applying a preset fills the Design fields below "
"and updates the live preview — review it, then Save Changes to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Punti tat-tluq b’klikk waħda. Meta tapplika preset, jimtlew l-oqsma tad-"
"Disinn hawn taħt u tiġi aġġornata l-previżjoni diretta — irrevediha, "
"imbagħad Issejvja l-Bidliet biex iżżommu."

msgid "Preset applied. Review the preview, then Save Changes to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Preset applikat. Irrevedi l-previżjoni, imbagħad Issejvja l-Bidliet biex "
"iżżommu."

msgid "Preview device width"
msgstr "Wisa’ tal-apparat fil-previżjoni"

msgid "Slim, square bar pinned to the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Strixxa rqiqa b’kantunieri kwadri mwaħħla mal-parti ta’ fuq tal-paġna."

msgid "Soft floating card in the bottom-right corner."
msgstr "Kard flottanti b’dehra ratba fir-rokna t’isfel tal-lemin."

msgid "Some colours have low contrast (%s) — see details."
msgstr "Xi kuluri għandhom kuntrast baxx (%s) — ara d-dettalji."
